1
0:00:00,300 --> 0:00:05,460
Across Afghanistan, talented students —
especially women and girls facing closed

2
0:00:05,460 --> 0:00:10,620
doors — must navigate foreign scholarship
systems in a second or third language.

3
0:00:10,670 --> 0:00:13,360
Requirements get lost in translation.

4
0:00:13,410 --> 0:00:18,848
BursYar turns a scholarship page into a
personal, evidence-based action plan.

5
0:00:20,300 --> 0:00:22,420
This is BursYar, running live.

6
0:00:22,470 --> 0:00:28,700
A guided workspace takes you from
possibility to a plan — discover, review, assess, act.

7
0:00:28,750 --> 0:00:30,330
Start with discovery.

8
0:00:30,380 --> 0:00:35,591
The research library searches and filters
historical leads — every record honestly

9
0:00:35,591 --> 0:00:37,843
labeled as needing re-verification.

10
0:00:40,300 --> 0:00:43,250
Then, read the official source — never a
rumor.

11
0:00:43,300 --> 0:00:46,190
Signed-out visitors meet a clear sign-in
gate.

12
0:00:46,240 --> 0:00:48,180
Nothing is fetched silently.

13
0:00:48,230 --> 0:00:53,593
With approval, BursYar fetches the official
page and shows exactly what it retrieved —

14
0:00:53,593 --> 0:00:55,360
before anything is analyzed.

15
0:00:55,410 --> 0:00:57,270
Documents stay private.

16
0:00:57,320 --> 0:01:02,724
You consent, review each extracted claim,
reject what is wrong — a rejected degree

17
0:01:02,724 --> 0:01:04,458
never enters your profile.

18
0:01:10,300 --> 0:01:14,740
This screen shows the analysis interface
with a simulated response.

19
0:01:14,790 --> 0:01:16,200
AI interprets.

20
0:01:16,250 --> 0:01:17,710
Evidence decides.

21
0:01:17,760 --> 0:01:23,280
Meta Muse Spark 1.3 reads the approved text
and selects candidate evidence.

22
0:01:23,330 --> 0:01:28,986
Two live runs are on record — four criteria
and two funding excerpts validated locally,

23
0:01:28,986 --> 0:01:31,420
one and one on hosted infrastructure.

24
0:01:31,470 --> 0:01:36,936
But the model is never trusted blindly:
every quotation is re-checked against the

25
0:01:36,936 --> 0:01:38,439
source, byte for byte.

26
0:01:40,300 --> 0:01:43,960
Every machine claim stays bound to its
quotation.

27
0:01:44,010 --> 0:01:44,680
Met.

28
0:01:44,730 --> 0:01:45,620
Not met.

29
0:01:45,670 --> 0:01:47,230
Or honestly unknown.

30
0:01:47,280 --> 0:01:52,220
The conservative compiler compares your
reviewed profile against the evidence.

31
0:01:52,270 --> 0:01:57,250
What it cannot prove, it calls unknown — and
unknown is never treated as eligible.

32
0:01:57,300 --> 0:02:03,157
When evidence is missing, PathFinder names
the gap and shows the legitimate next step:

33
0:02:03,157 --> 0:02:06,534
verify the exact requirement with the
institution.

34
0:02:10,300 --> 0:02:11,480
Reviewed by you.

35
0:02:11,530 --> 0:02:13,200
Never verified for you.

36
0:02:13,250 --> 0:02:18,340
Every claim carries its exact source
quotation — with an explicit warning until a

37
0:02:18,340 --> 0:02:19,740
human has reviewed it.

38
0:02:19,790 --> 0:02:21,250
In your own language.

39
0:02:21,300 --> 0:02:25,480
English, Dari, and Pashto — with full
right-to-left support.

40
0:02:25,530 --> 0:02:29,506
Translations are machine-drafted and still
await human review.

41
0:02:35,300 --> 0:02:42,550
BursYar: evidence-first AI, conservative
eligibility, actionable guidance, private by design.

42
0:02:42,600 --> 0:02:47,934
Built for the students who need clarity most
— so they can understand what a scholarship

43
0:02:47,934 --> 0:02:51,980
demands, gather the right proof, and take
the next step themselves.

44
0:02:52,030 --> 0:02:54,230
From possibility to a plan.

45
0:02:54,280 --> 0:02:55,200
BursYar.

46
0:02:55,250 --> 0:02:58,381
Opportunity should not be lost in
translation.
